  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "최고의 서비스를 제공하는\n쉬르 리슈 호텔에 어서 오세요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CACE0C7580020C11CBE44C2A4B97C0020C81CACF5D558B294000AC26CB9740020B9ACC2880020D638D154C5D00020C5B4C11C0020C624C138C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬과 최고의 시간을 보내기 위해\n힘을 가진 자가 책임을 다해야 한다는 게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n유카리 님의 생각이신 거지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020CD5CACE0C7580020C2DCAC04C7440020BCF4B0B4AE300020C704D574000AD798C7440020AC00C9C40020C790AC000020CC45C784C7440020B2E4D574C57C0020D55CB2E4B2940020AC8C00100001BE00000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7580020C0DDAC01C774C2E00020AC70C9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티를 인간과 포켓몬 모두\n최강인 도시로 만들고 싶은 게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그녀의 꿈이거든.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B97C0020C778AC04ACFC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020BAA8B450000ACD5CAC15C7780020B3C4C2DCB85C0020B9CCB4E4ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC8C00100001BE00000AADF8B140C7580020AFC8C774AC70B4E0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리 님과 MSBC가\n미르의 미래를 빛나게 할 거야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8ACFC0020004D005300420043AC00000ABBF8B974C7580020BBF8B798B97C0020BE5BB098AC8C0020D5600020AC70C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컨시어지 루주 덕분에\n쾌적하게 머무르고 있어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE8C2DCC5B4C9C00020B8E8C8FC0020B355BD84C5D0000ACF8CC801D558AC8C0020BA38BB34B974ACE00020C788C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컨시어지의 플랜에 따라\n미르 관광을 만끽하고 있답니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE8C2DCC5B4C9C0C7580020D50CB79CC5D00020B530B77C000ABBF8B9740020AD00AD11C7440020B9CCB07DD558ACE00020C788B2F5B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "관광 플랜도 좋지만\n나는 포켓몬 승부가 하고 싶어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD00AD110020D50CB79CB3C40020C88BC9C0B9CC000AB098B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80AC000020D558ACE00020C2F6C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호텔에는 포켓몬의\n트리밍 살롱도 있어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638D154C5D0B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC758000AD2B8B9ACBC0D0020C0B4B871B3C40020C788C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 단련시킬 수 있는\n트레이닝 룸도 최고야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B2E8B828C2DCD0AC0020C2180020C788B294000AD2B8B808C774B2DD0020B8F8B3C40020CD5CACE0C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미니멀한 생활을 추구한다면\n호텔 장기 투숙도 괜찮아",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B2C8BA40D55C0020C0DDD65CC7440020CD94AD6CD55CB2E4BA74000AD638D1540020C7A5AE300020D22CC219B3C40020AD1CCC2EC5440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 오세요\n쉬르 리슈 그랜드 호텔입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C624C138C694000AC26CB9740020B9ACC2880020ADF8B79CB4DC0020D638D154C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 오세요\n쉬르 리슈 그랜드 호텔입니다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C624C138C694000AC26CB9740020B9ACC2880020ADF8B79CB4DC0020D638D154C785B2C8B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 여러 레스토랑을\n투어로 다녀 보고 싶어",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020C5ECB7EC0020B808C2A4D1A0B791C744000AD22CC5B4B85C0020B2E4B1400020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 기회에 미르의 포켓몬을\n잡아 보고 싶은걸",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020AE30D68CC5D00020BBF8B974C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AC7A1C5440020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C740AC780000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두가 원하는 걸 하기에는\n시간이 부족한데...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450AC000020C6D0D558B2940020AC780020D558AE30C5D0B294000AC2DCAC04C7740020BD80C871D55CB370002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "친구들이\n사 오라고 한 게 잔뜩 있어",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE5CAD6CB4E4C774000AC0AC0020C624B77CACE00020D55C0020AC8C0020C794B7290020C788C5B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MSBC의 파티에\n몰래 들어가 보자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005300420043C7580020D30CD2F0C5D0000ABAB0B7980020B4E4C5B4AC000020BCF4C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "들켰다간\n무서운 언니한테 혼날 텐데...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E4CF30B2E4AC04000ABB34C11CC6B40020C5B8B2C8D55CD14C0020D63CB0A00020D150B370002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음에 주력으로 삼을 포켓몬의\n육성 플랜은 세워 뒀어?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC5D00020C8FCB825C73CB85C0020C0BCC7440020D3ECCF13BAACC758000AC721C1310020D50CB79CC7400020C138C6CC0020B480C5B4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직 고민 중이야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n밸런스 있게 기술을 가르치는 게 좋을까\n특정 타입을 철저히 견제하는 게 좋을까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C10020ACE0BBFC0020C911C774C57C002E00100001BE01000ABC38B7F0C2A40020C788AC8C0020AE30C220C7440020AC00B974CE58B2940020AC8C0020C88BC744AE4C000AD2B9C8150020D0C0C785C7440020CCA0C800D7880020ACACC81CD558B2940020AC8C0020C88BC744AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "언제나 훌륭한 요리를 줘서\n감사하다고 셰프에게 전해 줘!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B8C81CB0980020D6CCB96DD55C0020C694B9ACB97C0020C918C11C000AAC10C0ACD558B2E4ACE00020C170D504C5D0AC8C0020C804D5740020C91800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희 호텔의 셰프는\n즈미 님의 수제자시거든요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76C0020D638D154C7580020C170D504B294000AC988BBF80020B2D8C7580020C218C81CC790C2DCAC70B4E0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
